    reg {
        name = "Horizontal filter coefficient address";
        desc = "Node word 17 at node offset 0x44. The module loads five filter-parameter tables (TdeHalInit / TdeHalLoadFiltParam, allocated in MMZ) and writes the address chosen by the scale step (TdeHalGetResizeParaHTable). Source: hi3520D_tde.ko TdeHalNodeSet* (offsets and bit positions) and HiSTB v1 tde_hal.h (names). Third pass (PROVEN from TdeHalLoadFiltParam and TdeHalFillHFilterAddrByType): the horizontal table block holds 6 tables in 160 byte slots (33 words, 4 signed bytes each = 8 symmetric taps in the stored half-form; 132 bytes used). The slot is chosen by the horizontal step (12 bit fraction, 4096 = 1.0): up to 2048 slot 0, up to 4096 slot 1, up to 8192 slot 2, up to 12412 slot 3, up to 16384 slot 4, above slot 5 (type 0). The module has 7 coefficient sets; set 0 was used. Meaning of the taps per phase is not decoded. Unverified on hardware.";
        field {
            name = "addr";
            desc = "Physical address. VERIFIED IN THE HI3520D MODULE (HIGH): position seen in hi3520D_tde.ko. Not verified on hardware.";
            sw = rw;
            hw = r;
        } addr[31:0];
    } NODE_HF_COEF_ADDR @ 0x44;

