        desc = "Node word 27 at node offset 0x6C. Per-component minimum, bytes in the order B, G, R, A (little end first). Source: hi3520D_tde.ko TdeHalNodeSet* (offsets and bit positions) and HiSTB v1 tde_hal.h (names). Third pass (PROVEN): for ARGB formats the word is blue minimum in bits 7:0, green 15:8, red 23:16, alpha 31:24 (the vendor key command holds min, max, out flag, ignore flag per component). The key is set together with INS bit 12 and the five words ALU, CK_MIN, CK_MAX, CK_MASK.";
        field {
            name = "val";
            desc = "Packed minimum. VERIFIED IN THE HI3520D MODULE (HIGH): position seen in hi3520D_tde.ko. Not verified on hardware.";
            sw = rw;
            hw = r;
